#====================================================================
# E226 — HarmonyOS Python 3.12 os.popen 文本解码失败
# 知识条目，对应文档: doc/E226.md
#
# 格式规则:
#   - key: value（冒号后一个空格，value 到行尾）
#   - 多行值: 下一行以空格开头 = 续行
#   - 列表值: 逗号分隔
#   - 正则值: | 分隔多个模式
#   - 以 # 开头的行为注释
#   - 空行忽略
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     E226
trigger_tool: python|os.popen|subprocess
phase: testing
error_signature: TypeError: can't concat str to bytes|process_output = pipe\.read\(\)

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity: 2
category: python-popen-text-decoding
match_keywords: os.popen, pipe.read, TypeError, str, bytes, Python 3.12, HarmonyOS, subprocess.PIPE
title: Capture child output as bytes when HarmonyOS os.popen text decoding fails

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
root_cause: The validated HarmonyOS Python 3.12 os.popen text wrapper feeds a str fragment into a codec path expecting bytes, so pipe.read raises TypeError before the caller can inspect child output or exit status.
affected_scope: Python test drivers and build scripts on HarmonyOS PC that use os.popen().read() to capture output from native executables.
verification_cmd: Run the patched upstream CTest suite verbosely and require every logical case plus the final CTest summary to pass.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: capture-subprocess-bytes-explicitly
rec_description: Replace only the os.popen text wrapper with subprocess.PIPE byte capture, then decode once explicitly while preserving the command and return-code failure semantics.
rec_command: subprocess.Popen(cmd, shell=True, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.STDOUT).communicate()[0].decode('utf-8', errors='replace')
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: source-test-driver-patch

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: targeted-binary-pipe-wrapper
fallback_description: If the upstream command requires a shell pipeline for HarmonyOS execution policy, retain that command but keep stdout in binary mode and decode after communicate().
fallback_command: Run the same command through the shell with stdout=PIPE and text mode disabled.
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
forbid_1_pattern: except TypeError|skip.*runjsontests|JSONCPP_WITH_TESTS.*OFF
forbid_1_reason: Suppressing the exception or disabling the suite hides unexecuted upstream tests.
forbid_1_consequence: The package can be reported as tested even though parser and writer inputs never ran.

# ═══ Layer 4: 原则引用 ═══
principles:

